00:21:00.282 --> 00:21:02.662
But how do we build systems that naturally

00:21:02.662 --> 00:21:04.522
hold things in memory is the question.

00:21:04.892 --> 00:21:07.132
And need to hold things in memory over long

00:21:07.132 --> 00:21:09.231
spatial temporal time scales

00:21:09.232 --> 00:21:11.291
or scales. Now the universe has solved

00:21:11.292 --> 00:21:12.911
this problem. I will argue.

00:21:13.472 --> 00:21:15.812
The way it solved it is by creating waves

00:21:16.192 --> 00:21:18.262
or you know. Communicating with waves.

00:21:18.502 --> 00:21:20.581
You look out to the stars, the reason you can even

00:21:20.581 --> 00:21:22.422
see stars, because

00:21:22.882 --> 00:21:25.042
electromagnetic waves hit your retina. Right?

00:21:25.652 --> 00:21:27.892
In fact, even the brain turns

00:21:27.892 --> 00:21:30.091
