00:21:30.092 --> 00:21:30.991
that a little bit more.

00:21:32.912 --> 00:21:35.131
So first, I'll go do a little bit of history.

00:21:35.132 --> 00:21:36.222
This is old work

00:21:37.282 --> 00:21:39.441
mostly by This this is led

00:21:39.441 --> 00:21:41.662
