00:21:48.072 --> 00:21:50.312
create waves in their eternal

00:21:51.092 --> 00:21:53.281
internal latent spaces. And so

00:21:53.282 --> 00:21:55.782
we studied two tasks where you need memory

00:21:55.972 --> 00:21:58.432
the copy task and the adding

00:21:58.652 --> 00:22:01.052
task which make basically means you read something

00:22:01.052 --> 00:22:03.091
at some time and then you have to hold it

00:22:03.091 --> 00:22:05.512
