00:22:10.302 --> 00:22:12.582
a number get another number, add them up, and then

00:22:13.062 --> 00:22:15.212
add, you know, provide the sum. And if you look

00:22:15.212 --> 00:22:17.372
at these latent representations, which are the

00:22:17.372 --> 00:22:19.462
channels here, what you'll

00:22:19.462 --> 00:22:21.532
find is that in the

00:22:21.532 --> 00:22:23.692
sort of the one that creates waves, you

00:22:23.692 --> 00:22:25.772
get like channels and it will

00:22:25.772 --> 00:22:27.931
create an activation, and it will then hand it to

00:22:27.932 --> 00:22:29.702
the next channel, and it will hand it to the next

00:22:29.942 --> 00:22:32.082
hand it to the next channel, And so what happens is

00:22:32.082 --> 00:22:34.342
this information spins around in these channels.

00:22:35.622 --> 00:22:37.802
And the beauty is that that structure

00:22:38.102 --> 00:22:40.172
really helped solve these

00:22:40.902 --> 00:22:43.402
these problems where you need a long time memory.

