00:22:59.072 --> 00:23:01.312
Every neuron has a direction, a phase as

00:23:01.312 --> 00:23:03.452
well. They are coupled together

00:23:03.452 --> 00:23:05.632
next to each other and they want to synchronize,

00:23:06.012 --> 00:23:08.122
like actually, and this has is basis

00:23:08.122 --> 00:23:10.042
in neuroscience because in neuroscience,

00:23:11.472 --> 00:23:13.812
