00:23:26.182 --> 00:23:28.682
nice traveling waves. Through these networks.

00:23:30.012 --> 00:23:32.351
And then he did some tests and it worked surprisingly

00:23:32.492 --> 00:23:34.052
well. I would say state of the art. Art.

