know, sort of dictionary you can you

00:47:47.031 --> 00:47:49.332
can come up with and I I will highlight

00:47:49.332 --> 00:47:51.682
this one stochastic normalizing flows

00:47:52.481 --> 00:47:54.462
is equal to escorted free energies

