00:49:52.872 --> 00:49:54.292
pocket. And then later

00:49:54.932 --> 00:49:57.011
compensate for it. But now

00:49:57.011 --> 00:49:59.122
we know how to do that. We can

00:49:59.122 --> 00:50:01.442
train a diffusion model because or or a flow

00:50:01.442 --> 00:50:03.461
model. Which basically takes the

00:50:03.462 --> 00:50:05.082
initial distribution, and we know then

00:50:05.482 --> 00:50:07.512
how to find forces or

00:50:07.512 --> 00:50:09.452
velocities or whatever we call them to

00:50:09.592 --> 00:50:11.772
move that, to flow that into another distribution.

00:50:12.512 --> 00:50:14.752
So we train that model, and then we can use

00:50:14.752 --> 00:50:16.582
the Jarsinski equality, which I just

00:50:16.822 --> 00:50:18.952
explained in quite a bit of detail to measure

00:50:18.952 --> 00:50:21.052
over every step how much work did we do

00:50:21.291 --> 00:50:23.530
and then compute this expectation over the e

00:50:23.531 --> 00:50:25.672
to the minus work and that will give

00:50:25.972 --> 00:50:27.981
you an estimate for the free energy. And now

00:50:27.981 --> 00:50:30.082
you think this is great, this will work fantastic,

00:50:30.852 --> 00:50:33.012
until you try and then you figure out this

00:50:33.012 --> 00:50:35.262
is actually a very high variance estimator.

00:50:35.662 --> 00:50:37.362
Because it's in the exponent

00:50:37.682 --> 00:50:39.612
and it's basically the large

00:50:39.952 --> 00:50:42.112
the paths which have a lot a

00:50:42.112 --> 00:50:44.191
large amount of work completely dominate

00:50:44.192 --> 00:50:46.322
that estimate. So you need to do something about

00:50:46.322 --> 00:50:48.192
it. Now it turns out

00:50:48.592 --> 00:50:50.812
is a generalized Jazinsky quality, and

00:50:50.812 --> 00:50:53.031
this is cool because this is something we

00:50:53.251 --> 00:50:55.352
can directly import from this physics

00:50:55.352 --> 00:50:57.522
theory. The generalized equality

00:50:57.902 --> 00:50:59.971
says, if you have a control force you

00:50:59.972 --> 00:51:01.972
can, you know, I won't go into the details.

00:51:02.642 --> 00:51:04.652
If you optimize for certain

00:51:04.652 --> 00:51:06.717
